description=Needs Project Viewpoint QOL. Zoom only while holding a key (default Left Shift) and turning the mouse wheel, in bigger steps; releasing the key snaps back to the normal view. The plain mouse wheel no longer zooms. Key and step size in Options > Mods > Viewpoint Hold to Zoom.
